# Ursine Monstrosity: "+1/+1 for each card type among cards in your graveyard". Three combats mill an Ornithopter (artifact
# and creature: two types, so 3 + 2 = 5 power; Bot2's Island in its own graveyard adds nothing), a Lightning Bolt (instant:
# three types, 6) and a Forest (land: four types, 7). The Monstrosity attacks each turn as the ability makes it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sol Ring
Ursine Monstrosity
Forest
Forest x4
Forest
Ornithopter
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

